## Runtime bindings

External service IDs, workspace URLs, credentials, and customer data are
intentionally omitted from the public tree. Operators supply those bindings
through their host or a local, ignored configuration file.

## Security

Run `./scripts/public-safety-check.sh` before release. Do not commit secrets,
customer data, or live Notion collection UUIDs.
